# reg-rs's internal SQLite index and lockfiles are user-local
# state, not part of the regression baseline -- reg-rs reconstructs
# the .tdb at run time from the committed .rgt/.out/.err triple.
# All three of those are part of the golden baseline and must be
# committed: reg-rs's compare step matches stdout against .out,
# stderr against .err, and exit code against the value in .rgt.
*.tdb
*.tdb.lock
*.tdb-*
